Package: devjam-science-tools
Version: 2.0-1
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: inxi, hardinfo2, fastfetch, udev, shared-mime-info, desktop-file-utils, hicolor-icon-theme, curl, ca-certificates, mawk | gawk
Recommends: sudo
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Tools and file types for lab computers
 Tools for lab computers: print-system-information (hardware and
 software report), install-psychopy-opensesame, update-psychopy-installer,
 update-tobii-etm, make-osexp and setup-user-links. It also provides MIME
 types and icons for OpenSesame and PsychoPy experiments, udev rules for
 Teensy boards and a fixed desktop entry for Tobii Pro Eye Tracker
 Manager.
